OL,3,AUS has floated Ukraine ceding Donbas
OL,4,Afor Nato membership, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FZelensky has also consistently said
OL,7,FUkraine was unwilling to give up
OL,8,Fsovereign territory, despite Moscow's
OL,9,Fdemands for it to cede the Donbas.
